{"unit_id":"MyRemme__dsh-computer-use-guard#card-zh","repo":"MyRemme/dsh-computer-use-guard","commit":"62d720f3026a0494c42404e2e0c087085e88d5fa","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-computer-use-guard 是一个面向 DSH Web 客户端的 computer-use 权限插件。它在工具执行前为 cua-driver 工具提供 deny、ask、auto 三档授权，并通过审批请求等待用户确认。插件按观察、输入、浏览器、进程等类别选择默认档位，也支持显式放行与拒绝名单；拒绝名单优先，非空放行名单会将其他工具拒绝。设置页提供分类开关、精细控制和名单编辑。适合需要控制 DSH 桌面操作工具调用的用户；配置存于插件设置中，不需要额外密钥或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:431-458","lib/index.js:282-319","lib/client.js:344-432"]}
{"unit_id":"MyRemme__dsh-computer-use-guard#card-en","repo":"MyRemme/dsh-computer-use-guard","commit":"62d720f3026a0494c42404e2e0c087085e88d5fa","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-computer-use-guard adds deny, ask, and auto authorization tiers for DSH computer-use tools. It applies category defaults before execution, supports explicit allow and deny lists, and provides a web settings row for controls. Ask requests user approval. No API key or external service is required.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:431-458","lib/index.js:282-319","lib/client.js:344-432"]}
