{"unit_id":"MyRemme__dsh-computer-use-guard#feature-1","repo":"MyRemme/dsh-computer-use-guard","commit":"62d720f3026a0494c42404e2e0c087085e88d5fa","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-computer-use-guard 的功能「tiers」：deny、ask 和 auto 三档授权：工具在执行前按类别档位决定拒绝、等待用户批准或继续执行。 通过工具执行前钩子触发，输入工具类别或工具名，产出放行或拒绝结果。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:431-451"]}
{"unit_id":"MyRemme__dsh-computer-use-guard#feature-2","repo":"MyRemme/dsh-computer-use-guard","commit":"62d720f3026a0494c42404e2e0c087085e88d5fa","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-computer-use-guard 的功能「lists」：显式工具名单：逗号分隔的拒绝名单优先判定；非空放行名单只允许列出的裸工具名。 通过工具执行前钩子触发，输入工具类别或工具名，产出放行或拒绝结果。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:282-319"]}
{"unit_id":"MyRemme__dsh-computer-use-guard#feature-3","repo":"MyRemme/dsh-computer-use-guard","commit":"62d720f3026a0494c42404e2e0c087085e88d5fa","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-computer-use-guard 的功能「settings」：分类权限设置：Web 设置行展示常用类别与高级类别的三档控件，并可编辑允许和拒绝名单。 通过工具执行前钩子触发，输入工具类别或工具名，产出放行或拒绝结果。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:344-432"]}
{"unit_id":"MyRemme__dsh-computer-use-guard#feature-4","repo":"MyRemme/dsh-computer-use-guard","commit":"62d720f3026a0494c42404e2e0c087085e88d5fa","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-computer-use-guard 的功能「交互审批」：ask 档发起审批请求，只有用户一次性允许后工具调用才继续。通过执行前钩子触发，产出放行或拒绝结果。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:396-429"]}
